title The column split, three rows freed, and a lantern written narrower than its own reasoning
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, read the council rota row, send the increment
think The design read this lap follows named its own next step, so the lap was already scoped: split the widens column by kind in the scan, assert both halves in the witness, and let the queue re-sort.
think tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh already knew each declaration's visibility and threw its keyword away. The grep-sed-awk pipeline was replaced by one awk reading the whole declaration line, so it emits name, visibility, and kind -- fn, import, or const -- and the import case is decided by the line holding an import call rather than by guessing from the name.
think REACH_OK now prints widens_fn, widens_import, and widens_const beside widens, and every REACH_PRIVATE line carries kind= so a reader scanning the detail sees what each opening is.
think Four families asserted in tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish rather than three, because the closing GREEN line names four and a number a meter recites without asserting is a claim rather than a measurement (REDS %110).
obs The split reopened the queue. Three rows the single column priced as expensive open no function at all -- load_one at five hundred and forty-nine, read_own_line at four hundred and ninety-two, door_admits at four hundred and sixty-two -- every one of their openings an import binding that publishes a module the rung already names in its own head. Fifteen hundred carried lines the old column had hidden behind a number.
obs elder_waits is the one row that genuinely costs, and it now stands asserted as that shape: the symbol it reaches privately in all forty-three rungs is a function, so folding it opens what those rungs offer a caller.
obs Sum against union held from the design read: the six rows' widens_fn sums to a hundred and seventy-seven while the union of fn pairs is ninety-one, since choose_pass reaches both waits and may_pass. The sum-versus-union gap the read measured for the whole column reproduces inside the fn half.
obs REDS %135 booked and closed in the lap, and it is REDS %131 arriving a second time in a different shape. Citing the design read's dated filename in the carry meter's queue prose put two digit runs in a say line, and the prose-count guard refused both as recited counts -- reddening the whole choir of a hundred and eight.
obs The deeper fault is that the first repair was written narrower than its own reasoning. REDS %131 exempted a percent-sigilled row name because the sigil marks a constant term that never varies; the sentence it was actually proving is that a digit run belonging to a name cannot drift, so it is not a count. Written as sigil-only, the rule covered one of the two immutable-name shapes this tree writes and left the other to fire. A lantern that fires twice becomes a loom, so the exemption is now stated at the level of the reasoning.
obs The bound stays as tight as the sigil's, and the control proves it rather than the prose claiming it: a sentence citing a dated path and a body stamp is welcomed, and the same sentence with a bare eight-digit number beside the stamp draws exactly one refusal, on the bare number alone.
obs The choir caught this and the touched witness did not. Running only the witness a change touches proves the change; running the choir proves the tree. The red lived in a file the split never opened.
obs The REDS pin crossed its 24,576-byte bound as row %135 landed, so the closed 131-132 range folded to crux/archive/REDS-meter-prose-and-self-delegation-rows-131-132.md and the headline was re-derived from the spine rather than edited by hand -- rows 135, remainder 115. The monotone witness named all three disagreements before the edit and read ok after.
loom scan=ladder_reach_visibility split=by_kind families_asserted=4 free_rows_revealed=3 carried_lines_reopened=1503
loom witness=caravan_suite rungs=108 verdict=green era_suite=11 verdict=green
file tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh the widens column split into fn, import, and const, read from each declaration's own line
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish four families asserted by kind, and every family the closing line names
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the queue prose refreshed, since the split changed what standing behind a widening means
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_prose_count_scan.sh a one-clock stamp read as a name, both shapes the naming law defines
file tools/caravan_ladder_copy_witness.rish the stamp welcome and refusal proven on generated controls, beneath the sigil pair they extend
file crux/REDS.md row %135 booked and closed, the 131-132 range folded, the headline re-derived from the spine
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now refilled with the reopened queue and the next fold head
recommend keep-going load_one is the head under the split -- sixty rungs by eleven lines returning five hundred and forty-nine, its whole widening a hundred and twenty import bindings and not one function, so the fold is free of the only cost that was ever real
